Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant (3/3) and three untapped Mountains and have Trumpet Blast (attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn) in hand. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-attacking-creatures-at-resolution | "Attacking creatures" are determined as the spell resolves (CR 608.2h, 506.4): cast Trumpet Blast after the Giant is declared as an attacker and it deals 5; cast in the main phase it affects nothing
